/*⁣‌‌‍‌‌‍⁠‍​‍‌‍​‍​​⁠​‍​​‍‌‌​​⁠⁠⁠‌‍​​⁠​‌‌‍​‍‌‌‌‍‍⁠‍​​‍‌​​⁠⁠​‍‍‌⁠‌‍‍​⁣ ==========================================================
   WeChat 水色 by淚
   跟随系统日夜切换
   ========================================================== */
.chat-detail-screen, #chat-detail-screen{
  /* ---- 白天 ---- */
  --wx-bar:      rgba(242,242,242,.98);   /* 顶栏 + 底栏:94% 磨砂,只透颜色 */
  --wx-blur:     blur(30px) saturate(180%);
  --wx-line:     rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  --wx-me:       #EBF5FF;
  --wx-me-ink:   #111111;
  --wx-ta:       #FFFFFF;
  --wx-ink:      #111111;
  --wx-gray:     #9B9B9B;
  --wx-gray-dk:  #6B6B6B;
  --wx-quote:      #F0F0F0;
  --wx-quote-line: rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  --wx-chip:       rgba(240,240,240,.95);
  --wx-chip-line:  rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  --wx-chip-ink:   #8A8A8A;
  --wx-pill:     #E2E2E2;
  --wx-input:    #FFFFFF;
  --wx-mic:      #A3A3A3;
  --wx-orange:   #FF9500;
  --wx-orange-done: #FBC48A;
  --wx-red:      #FA9D3B;
  --wx-green:    #07C160;
  --wx-gift-tail:#1A4088;
  --wx-think:    #9B9B9B;

  --wx-head-h: 44px;
  --wx-bar-h:  64px;
  --wx-bar-lift: -4px;
  --wx-radius: 4px;
  --wx-tail-top: 11px;
  --wx-gap-sub: 4px;
  --wx-img-w: 160px;
  --wx-img-shift: 12px;
  --wx-btn: 30px;
  --wx-input-h: 40px;
  --wx-avatar: 38px;
  --wx-avatar-r: 4px;
  --wx-think-shift: -40px;

  --wx-stack-1: url("https://pic1.imgdb.cn/i/034smcI1JG0UgrGM6zsxV3.jpg");
  --wx-stack-2: url("https://pic1.imgdb.cn/i/034smcIUM7HimWljNW83RO.jpg");
  --wx-gift-img: url("https://pic1.imgdb.cn/i/034uJylYXc5CdtyMa18FQf.jpg");

  /* ---- 糯叽机变量 ---- */
  --chat-header-bg:transparent;
  --chat-header-bg-image:none;
  --chat-header-blur:0px;
  --chat-header-border:var(--wx-line);
  --chat-header-height:var(--wx-head-h);
  --chat-header-title-color:var(--wx-ink);
  --chat-header-title-size:17px;
  --chat-header-title-weight:600;
  --chat-header-subtitle-color:transparent;
  --chat-header-icon-color:var(--wx-ink);
  --chat-message-max-width:100%;

  --plain-avatar-size:var(--wx-avatar);
  --plain-avatar-radius:var(--wx-avatar-r);
  --avatar-size:var(--wx-avatar);
  --avatar-radius:var(--wx-avatar-r);
  --avatar-border:none;
  --avatar-shadow:none;

  --bubble-me-bg:var(--wx-me);
  --bubble-me-bg-gradient:initial;
  --bubble-me-color:var(--wx-me-ink);
  --bubble-me-border:none;
  --bubble-me-shadow:none;
  --bubble-me-padding:7px 12px;
  --bubble-me-font-size:16px;
  --bubble-me-line-height:22px;
  --bubble-me-radius:4px;
  --bubble-me-radius-first:4px;
  --bubble-me-radius-mid:4px;
  --bubble-me-radius-last:4px;
  --bubble-them-bg:var(--wx-ta);
  --bubble-them-bg-gradient:initial;
  --bubble-them-color:var(--wx-ink);
  --bubble-them-border:none;
  --bubble-them-shadow:none;
  --bubble-them-padding:7px 12px;
  --bubble-them-font-size:16px;
  --bubble-them-line-height:22px;
  --bubble-them-radius:4px;
  --bubble-them-radius-first:4px;
  --bubble-them-radius-mid:4px;
  --bubble-them-radius-last:4px;
  --bubble-them-backdrop:none;
  --bubble-me-backdrop:none;

  --timestamp-color:var(--wx-chip-ink);
  --date-divider-bg:var(--wx-chip);
  --date-divider-color:var(--wx-chip-ink);
  --status-color:var(--wx-gray);

  --translation-btn-color:transparent;
  --translation-btn-opacity:1;
  --translation-animation:none;

  --reply-detached-name-suffix:"：";
  --reply-detached-name-color:var(--wx-gray-dk);
  --reply-detached-text-color:var(--wx-gray-dk);

  --thinking-btn-bg:transparent;
  --thinking-btn-border:none;
  --thinking-btn-shadow:none;
  --thinking-btn-color:var(--wx-think);
  --thinking-arrow-color:transparent;

  --input-area-bg:transparent;
  --input-area-bg-image:none;
  --input-area-blur:0px;
  --input-area-border-top:.5px solid var(--wx-line);
  --input-area-padding:6px 8px 6px 4px;
  --input-area-min-height:0px;
  --input-box-bg:var(--wx-input);
  --input-box-border:none;
  --input-box-color:var(--wx-ink);
  --input-box-placeholder:transparent;
  --input-box-radius:4px;
  --input-box-shadow:none;
  --input-caret-color:var(--wx-green);
  --send-btn-bg:var(--wx-green);
  --send-btn-color:#ffffff;
  --send-btn-radius:4px;
  --send-btn-size:auto;
  --send-btn-shadow:none;
  --btn-send-scale:1;
  --plus-btn-bg:transparent;

  --transfer-card-bg:var(--wx-orange);
  --transfer-card-border:none;
  --transfer-card-radius:4px;
  --transfer-card-shadow:none;
  --transfer-content-padding:0;
  --transfer-content-gap:2px;
  --transfer-header-margin-bottom:0;
  --transfer-icon-bg:transparent;
  --transfer-icon-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-me-card-bg:var(--wx-orange);
  --transfer-me-card-border:none;
  --transfer-me-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-me-label-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-me-subtitle-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-me-status-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-me-divider-color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  --transfer-them-card-bg:var(--wx-orange);
  --transfer-them-card-border:none;
  --transfer-them-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-them-label-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-them-subtitle-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-them-status-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-them-divider-color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  --transfer-success-card-bg:var(--wx-orange-done);
  --transfer-success-card-border:none;
  --transfer-success-icon-bg:transparent;
  --transfer-success-icon-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-success-label-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-success-status-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-success-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-rejected-card-bg:var(--wx-orange-done);
  --transfer-rejected-card-border:none;
  --transfer-rejected-icon-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-rejected-label-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-rejected-status-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-rejected-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-expired-card-bg:var(--wx-orange-done);
  --transfer-expired-card-border:none;
  --transfer-expired-icon-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-expired-label-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-expired-status-color:#ffffff;
  --transfer-expired-amount-color:#ffffff;
  --videocall-bg-connected:var(--wx-ta);
  --videocall-bg-interrupted:var(--wx-ta);
  --videocall-bg-missed:var(--wx-ta);
  --videocall-border-connected:none;
  --videocall-border-interrupted:none;
  --videocall-border-missed:none;
  --videocall-radius:4px;
  --videocall-shadow:none;
  --videocall-shadow-missed:none;
}

/* ==========================================================
   0. 布局  顶栏 / 底栏悬浮 · 消息区延伸到两者下面
   ========================================================== */
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom:has(.header-profile-section){
  position:absolute !important; top:0 !important; left:0 !important; right:0 !important;
  z-index:50 !important; isolation:isolate !important; overflow:visible !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .input-area-custom{
  position:absolute !important; left:0 !important; right:0 !important; bottom:0 !important;
  top:auto !important; z-index:50 !important; isolation:isolate !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .chat-message-list-custom{
  padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px) + var(--wx-head-h) + 8px) !important;
  padding-bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + var(--wx-bar-h) + var(--wx-bar-lift) + 8px) !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .chat-messages-area{
  scroll-padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px) + var(--wx-head-h)) !important;
  scroll-padding-bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + var(--wx-bar-h) + var(--wx-bar-lift)) !important;
}

/* ==========================================================
   1. 顶栏  独立磨砂背板(只透颜色) · 头像/在线隐藏 · 昵称居中
            退出=返回箭头 / 设置=三个点 / 电话·视频=隐形原位可点
            AI 回复中:昵称换成"对方正在输入中..."
   ========================================================== */
/* 顶栏本身不涂色,颜色和模糊交给下面的背板 */
.chat-detail-screen :is(.chat-header-custom, .glass-header):has(.header-profile-section){
  background:transparent !important; background-image:none !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important; backdrop-filter:none !important;
  border:0 !important; box-shadow:none !important;
  min-height:var(--wx-head-h) !important;
}
/* 磨砂背板 */
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom:has(.header-profile-section)::before{
  content:"" !important; display:block !important;
  position:absolute !important; inset:0 !important;
  background:var(--wx-bar) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:var(--wx-blur) !important; backdrop-filter:var(--wx-blur) !important;
  border-bottom:.5px solid var(--wx-line) !important;
  pointer-events:none !important; z-index:-1 !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom:has(.header-profile-section)::after{ content:none !important; }
/* 内层(嵌套时)透明 */
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .glass-header{
  position:relative !important;
  background:transparent !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important; backdrop-filter:none !important;
  border:0 !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .glass-header::before,
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .glass-header::after{ display:none !important; }
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom:has(.header-profile-section) .glass-header *:not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-dot):not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-num){
  background-color:transparent !important;
}

.chat-detail-screen .header-avatar-container,
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-avatar,
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-subtitle{ display:none !important; }

.chat-detail-screen .header-profile-section{
  position:absolute !important;
  left:50% !important; top:auto !important; bottom:calc(var(--wx-head-h) / 2) !important;
  transform:translate(-50%, 50%) !important;
  margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important;
  display:flex !important; align-items:center !important; justify-content:center !important;
  max-width:60vw !important; background:transparent !important; z-index:5 !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .header-profile-section > *{ margin:0 !important; }
.chat-detail-screen .header-profile-section::before,
.chat-detail-screen .header-profile-section::after{ content:none !important; }
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title{
  margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important; max-width:60vw !important;
  background:transparent !important; border:0 !important; text-shadow:none !important;
  backdrop-filter:none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important;
  color:var(--wx-ink) !important; font-size:17px !important; font-weight:600 !important;
  line-height:1 !important; text-align:center !important;
  white-space:nowrap !important; overflow:hidden !important; text-overflow:ellipsis !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::before,
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after{ content:none !important; }

.chat-detail-screen .nuo-typing-indicator{ display:none !important; }
.chat-detail-screen .msg-bubble-wrapper:has(.msg-streaming){ display:none !important; }
#chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator, .msg-streaming) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title,
.chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator, .msg-streaming) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title{
  font-size:0 !important; color:transparent !important;
}
#chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator, .msg-streaming) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after,
.chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator, .msg-streaming) .chat-header-custom .chat-header-title::after{
  content:"对方正在输入中..." !important;
  font-size:17px; font-weight:600; line-height:1; color:var(--wx-ink); white-space:nowrap;
}

.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-back, .header-btn-info, .header-btn-phone, .header-btn-video){
  position:relative !important;
  width:36px !important; height:36px !important; min-width:36px !important;
  padding:0 !important; border-radius:0 !important;
  display:flex !important; align-items:center !important; justify-content:center !important;
  background:transparent !important; background-image:none !important;
  backdrop-filter:none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important;
  border:0 !important; box-shadow:none !important;
  color:transparent !important; overflow:visible !important; z-index:6 !important;
  pointer-events:auto !important;
}
.chat-detail-screen .header-btn-back > *:not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-dot):not(.nuo-chat-header-unread-num),
.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-info, .header-btn-phone, .header-btn-video) > *{ opacity:0 !important; }
.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-phone, .header-btn-video)::before,
.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-phone, .header-btn-video)::after,
.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-back, .header-btn-info)::after{ content:none !important; }
.chat-detail-screen :is(.header-btn-back, .header-btn-info)::before{
  content:"" !important; position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  background-color:var(--wx-ink); pointer-events:none;
}
.chat-detail-screen .header-btn-back::before{
  width:22px; height:22px;
  -webkit-mask:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='black' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polyline points='15 4 7 12 15 20'/></svg>") no-repeat center/contain;
          mask:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='black' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polyline points='15 4 7 12 15 20'/></svg>") no-repeat center/contain;
}
.chat-detail-screen .header-btn-info::before{
  width:24px; height:24px;
  -webkit-mask:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><circle cx='5' cy='12' r='1.8'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='1.8'/><circle cx='19' cy='12' r='1.8'/></svg>") no-repeat center/contain;
          mask:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><circle cx='5' cy='12' r='1.8'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='1.8'/><circle cx='19' cy='12' r='1.8'/></svg>") no-repeat center/contain;
}

/* ==========================================================
   2. 头像  38px · 圆角 4px
   ========================================================== */
:is(.msg-avatar-them-container, .msg-avatar-me-container){
  width:var(--wx-avatar) !important; height:var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  min-width:var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  border:0 !important; box-shadow:none !important;
}
:is(.msg-avatar-them-inner, .msg-avatar-me-inner, .msg-avatar-custom){
  width:var(--wx-avatar) !important; height:var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  min-width:var(--wx-avatar) !important;
  border:0 !important; border-radius:var(--wx-avatar-r) !important;
  box-shadow:none !important; overflow:hidden !important;
  object-fit:cover !important; background-size:cover !important; background-position:center !important;
}
:is(.msg-avatar-them-inner, .msg-avatar-me-inner) img{
  width:100% !important; height:100% !important;
  border-radius:var(--wx-avatar-r) !important; object-fit:cover !important;
}

/* ==========================================================
   3. 气泡  方角 4px · 靠头像那侧三角尾巴 · 16/22 字号
   ========================================================== */
.msg-bubble-wrapper{ position:relative !important; }
.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom,
.bubble-deco-me, .bubble-deco-them,
.msg-bubble-container, .msg-content-stack{ overflow:visible !important; }
.msg-content-stack{ position:relative !important; }

.bubble-them-custom,
.bubble-me-custom{
  position:relative !important; box-sizing:border-box !important;
  max-width:68vw !important;
  padding:7px 12px !important;
  border:0 !important; border-radius:var(--wx-radius) !important;
  box-shadow:none !important; text-shadow:none !important;
  backdrop-filter:none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important;
  font-size:16px !important; line-height:22px !important;
}
.bubble-me-custom{ background:var(--wx-me) !important; background-image:none !important; color:var(--wx-me-ink) !important; }
.bubble-them-custom{ background:var(--wx-ta) !important; background-image:none !important; color:var(--wx-ink) !important; }
.bubble-me-custom :is(span,p,div,a,strong,em):not(.msg-translation-btn):not(.msg-translation-btn *){ color:var(--wx-me-ink) !important; }
.bubble-them-custom :is(span,p,div,a,strong,em):not(.msg-translation-btn):not(.msg-translation-btn *){ color:var(--wx-ink) !important; }

.bubble-them-custom :is(p,span,div):not(.msg-translation-wrapper):not(.msg-translation-btn):not(.msg-translation-btn *),
.bubble-me-custom :is(p,span,div):not(.msg-translation-wrapper):not(.msg-translation-btn):not(.msg-translation-btn *){
  max-width:none !important;
}
.bubble-them-custom, .bubble-me-custom,
.bubble-them-custom :is(p,span,div), .bubble-me-custom :is(p,span,div){
  word-break:normal !important; overflow-wrap:anywhere !important;
  line-break:auto !important; text-wrap:wrap !important;
}

.bubble-me-custom::before,
.bubble-them-custom::before{ content:none !important; }
.bubble-me-custom::after,
.bubble-them-custom::after{
  content:"" !important; position:absolute !important;
  top:var(--wx-tail-top) !important; bottom:auto !important;
  width:0 !important; height:0 !important;
  border-top:6px solid transparent !important; border-bottom:6px solid transparent !important;
  background:none !important; pointer-events:none !important; z-index:1 !important;
}
.bubble-me-custom::after{
  right:-6px !important; left:auto !important;
  border-left:6px solid var(--wx-me) !important; border-right:0 !important;
}
.bubble-them-custom::after{
  left:-6px !important; right:auto !important;
  border-right:6px solid var(--wx-ta) !important; border-left:0 !important;
}
:is(.bubble-them-custom,.bubble-me-custom):has(img, video, [class*="card"]){
  background:transparent !important; padding:0 !important;
}
:is(.bubble-them-custom,.bubble-me-custom):has(img, video, [class*="card"])::after{ display:none !important; }

/* ==========================================================
   4. 时间戳 / 日期 / 撤回  居中方角小框
   ========================================================== */
:is(.timestamp-custom, .date-divider-custom, .msg-recalled .msg-system){
  display:table !important; box-sizing:border-box !important;
  width:auto !important; max-width:80vw !important;
  margin:8px auto !important; padding:5px 10px !important;
  background:var(--wx-chip) !important;
  border:.5px solid var(--wx-chip-line) !important; border-radius:var(--wx-radius) !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px) !important; backdrop-filter:blur(6px) !important;
  color:var(--wx-chip-ink) !important; opacity:1 !important;
  font-size:13px !important; line-height:16px !important; font-weight:700 !important;
  letter-spacing:.02em !important; text-align:center !important; white-space:nowrap !important;
}
.msg-recalled .msg-system *{ color:var(--wx-chip-ink) !important; }
.msg-status-custom{ color:var(--wx-gray) !important; }

/* ==========================================================
   5. 引用  正文气泡在上 · 浅灰方角引用框在下 · 严格两行
   ========================================================== */
.msg-reply-block{ display:none !important; }
.msg-reply-block-detached{
  display:-webkit-box !important; -webkit-box-orient:vertical !important; -webkit-line-clamp:2 !important;
  position:relative !important; box-sizing:content-box !important;
  width:max-content !important; min-width:0 !important; max-width:calc(60vw - 18px) !important;
  height:auto !important; max-height:36px !important;
  margin:6px 0 0 0 !important; padding:0 9px !important;
  background:var(--wx-quote) !important;
  border:0 !important; border-left:0 !important;
  border-top:6px solid var(--wx-quote) !important; border-bottom:6px solid var(--wx-quote) !important;
  border-radius:var(--wx-radius) !important;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 .5px var(--wx-quote-line) !important;
  backdrop-filter:none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter:none !important;
  transform:none !important; clip-path:none !important; opacity:1 !important;
  font-size:13px !important; line-height:18px !important; color:var(--wx-gray-dk) !important;
  white-space:normal !important; word-break:break-word !important; overflow:hidden !important;
}
.msg-reply-detached-me{ align-self:flex-end !important; }
.msg-reply-detached-them{ align-self:flex-start !important; }
.msg-reply-block-detached::before,
.msg-reply-block-detached::after{ content:none !important; }
.msg-reply-block-detached *{
  display:inline !important; margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important;
  font-size:13px !important; line-height:18px !important;
  font-style:normal !important; font-weight:400 !important;
  opacity:1 !important; text-transform:none !important;
  white-space:normal !important; max-width:none !important; overflow:visible !important;
  color:var(--wx-gray-dk) !important; background:transparent !important;
}

/* ==========================================================
